      "verified": true,
      "doc_url": "https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/labview-api-ref/page/functions/rotate.html",
      "note": "Rotates x left by y bits (y<0 rotates right), modulo x's integer width. Emitted via the ROTATE op handler, which reads the width from x's int type and defers to _lv.rotate. Pane observed on MD5 FGHI functions (x=U32 idx1, y=I32 idx2, out idx0)."
