      "verified": true,
      "doc_url": "https://www.ni.com/docs/en-US/bundle/labview-api-ref/page/functions/type-cast.html",
      "note": "Reinterprets x's flat bytes as the type-prototype's type (LabVIEW: flatten then unflatten). Emitted via TYPE_CAST op handler, which reads the source type from in_0 and the dest type from the output and defers to _lv.type_cast. Terminal types here are nominal; the handler reads real per-node types. Numeric-scalar/array<->string supported (big-endian, no length prefix); cluster/variant/float pairs raise loudly pending fuller flat-format support."
    },
